In order to run Veloren you need XDG dirs PICTURES configured in your home.
Alternatively you can run from the console:
$ VOXYGEN_SCREENSHOT=/tmp/ veloren-voxygen

You can manually configure ~/.config/user-dirs.dirs:
XDG_PICTURES_DIR="$HOME/Pictures"

Or you can install xdg-user-dirs and run xdg-user-dirs-update:
$ doas pkg_add xdg-user-dirs
$ xdg-user-dirs-update

https://wiki.veloren.net/wiki/Hosting_a_Server
https://book.veloren.net/players/server-hosting/on-your-pc.html
If needed open ports in your firewall: 14004 (TCP)
$ veloren-server-cli
